---
// src/pages/terms.astro
import Layout from "../layouts/Layout.astro";
---

<Layout title="Terms of Service | PSFF Digital Platform">
  <article
    class="w-full border-b border-zinc-900 py-16 sm:py-24 px-6 sm:px-12 selection:bg-[#D9381E] selection:text-[#F6F4EE]"
  >
    <div class="max-w-3xl mx-auto space-y-12 sm:space-y-16">
      <!-- Page Header -->
      <header class="space-y-4 border-b border-zinc-300 pb-8">
        <div
          class="font-mono text-xs uppercase tracking-widest text-zinc-500 flex items-center gap-2"
        >
          <a href="/" class="hover:text-[#D9381E] transition-colors"
            >&larr; Home</a
          >
          <span>/</span>
          <span>Legal</span>
          <span>/</span>
          <span>Terms of Service</span>
        </div>

        <h1
          class="text-4xl sm:text-5xl lg:text-6xl font-black uppercase tracking-tight text-[#161616] leading-none"
        >
          Terms of Service
        </h1>

        <p
          class="font-mono text-xs sm:text-sm text-[#D9381E] font-bold uppercase tracking-wider"
        >
          Website &amp; Digital Portal Usage Terms
        </p>
      </header>

      <!-- Main Content -->
      <div
        class="space-y-10 font-serif text-lg sm:text-xl text-zinc-800 leading-relaxed sm:leading-loose"
      >
        <p
          class="first-letter:text-6xl first-letter:font-black first-letter:float-left first-letter:mr-4 first-letter:leading-none first-letter:text-[#161616]"
        >
          Welcome to the official web platform of the <strong
            >Pazhassi Short Film Festival (PSFF)</strong
          >, operated collaboratively by <strong
            >Drishtidosham Chalachithravedi</strong
          > and <strong>Pazhassi Raja Smaraka Granthalayam</strong>. These Terms
          of Service govern your access to and use of this website, our
          registration portal, jury evaluation workspace, and digital services.
        </p>

        <div class="space-y-4">
          <h2
            class="font-mono text-base sm:text-lg font-black uppercase text-[#161616] border-b-2 border-[#161616] pb-1"
          >
            1. Acceptance of Terms
          </h2>
          <p class="text-base sm:text-lg">
            By accessing or browsing this website, creating an account,
            submitting entry materials, or using our evaluation workspace, you
            agree to be bound by these Terms of Service and our Privacy Policy.
            If you do not agree to these terms, please refrain from using the
            platform.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="space-y-4">
          <h2
            class="font-mono text-base sm:text-lg font-black uppercase text-[#161616] border-b-2 border-[#161616] pb-1"
          >
            2. Platform Purpose &amp; Services
          </h2>
          <p class="text-base sm:text-lg">
            This digital platform is provided solely for festival information
            dissemination, film competition entries, digital receipt uploads,
            administrative verification, and authorized jury evaluations.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="space-y-4">
          <h2
            class="font-mono text-base sm:text-lg font-black uppercase text-[#161616] border-b-2 border-[#161616] pb-1"
          >
            3. User Accounts &amp; Access Security
          </h2>
          <ul
            class="font-mono text-xs sm:text-sm space-y-2.5 list-disc list-inside text-zinc-700"
          >
            <li>
              <strong>Authorized Portals:</strong> Access to the Jury Evaluation Workspace
              and Admin Command Center is restricted to authorized credentials issued
              by the Festival Convener.
            </li>
            <li>
              <strong>Credential Confidentiality:</strong> Users are responsible for
              maintaining the confidentiality of their login credentials and account
              security. Sharing accounts or attempting unauthorized access is strictly
              prohibited.
            </li>
            <li>
              <strong>Account Termination:</strong> The festival directorate reserves
              the right to suspend or revoke access to any account found violating
              platform security or integrity.
            </li>
          </ul>
        </div>

        <div class="space-y-4">
          <h2
            class="font-mono text-base sm:text-lg font-black uppercase text-[#161616] border-b-2 border-[#161616] pb-1"
          >
            4. Acceptable Use &amp; Prohibited Conduct
          </h2>
          <p class="text-base sm:text-lg">
            While using this website and submission portal, you agree not to:
          </p>
          <ul
            class="font-mono text-xs sm:text-sm space-y-2.5 list-disc list-inside text-zinc-700"
          >
            <li>
              Upload fraudulent payment receipts, falsified transaction
              references (UTRs), or inaccurate filmmaker details.
            </li>
            <li>
              Attempt to bypass authentication, scrape data, reverse-engineer,
              disrupt server operations, or probe system vulnerabilities.
            </li>
            <li>
              Capture, screen-record, redistribute, or download private screener
              links or protected films hosted on or embedded within the portal.
            </li>
            <li>
              Use the website to transmit malicious scripts, worms, or
              disruptive automated requests.
            </li>
          </ul>
        </div>

        <div class="space-y-4">
          <h2
            class="font-mono text-base sm:text-lg font-black uppercase text-[#161616] border-b-2 border-[#161616] pb-1"
          >
            5. Intellectual Property on the Website
          </h2>
          <p class="text-base sm:text-lg">
            All website design, brand identities, custom code, layout
            typography, and editorial text are the property of Drishtidosham
            Chalachithravedi and Pazhassi Raja Smaraka Granthalayam. Film
            posters, stills, trailers, and screener materials displayed or
            hosted belong entirely to their respective copyright holders and
            filmmakers.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="space-y-4">
          <h2
            class="font-mono text-base sm:text-lg font-black uppercase text-[#161616] border-b-2 border-[#161616] pb-1"
          >
            6. Service Availability &amp; Disclaimer of Warranties
          </h2>
          <p class="text-base sm:text-lg">
            We strive to ensure continuous uptime and reliable operation of the
            submission and evaluation portal. However, the site is provided on
            an &ldquo;as is&rdquo; and &ldquo;as available&rdquo; basis. The
            organizers are not liable for temporary technical downtimes,
            third-party video host outages (e.g., Vimeo, YouTube), or network
            transmission interruptions beyond our direct control.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="space-y-4">
          <h2
            class="font-mono text-base sm:text-lg font-black uppercase text-[#161616] border-b-2 border-[#161616] pb-1"
          >
            7. Limitation of Liability
          </h2>
          <p class="text-base sm:text-lg">
            In no event shall the festival committee, conveners, parent
            institutions, or web administrators be liable for any direct,
            indirect, incidental, or consequential damages resulting from the
            use or inability to use this digital platform.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="space-y-4">
          <h2
            class="font-mono text-base sm:text-lg font-black uppercase text-[#161616] border-b-2 border-[#161616] pb-1"
          >
            8. Changes to These Terms
          </h2>
          <p class="text-base sm:text-lg">
            The festival administration reserves the right to modify these Terms
            of Service as necessary. Updated versions will be published directly
            on this page with immediate effect.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="space-y-4">
          <h2
            class="font-mono text-base sm:text-lg font-black uppercase text-[#161616] border-b-2 border-[#161616] pb-1"
          >
            9. Contact Information
          </h2>
          <p class="text-base sm:text-lg">
            For technical issues, account support, or inquiries regarding
            website terms, please reach out to our team at <a
              href="mailto:convener@psff.in"
              class="text-[#D9381E] font-bold underline underline-offset-4"
              >convener@psff.in</a
            >.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Footer Note -->
      <footer
        class="border-t border-zinc-300 pt-8 flex flex-col sm:flex-row items-start sm:items-center justify-between gap-4 font-mono text-xs text-zinc-600"
      >
        <span>PSFF Digital Platform &bull; Mananthavady, Wayanad</span>
        <a
          href="/"
          class="font-bold text-[#161616] hover:text-[#D9381E] underline underline-offset-4"
        >
          &larr; Back to Festival Portal
        </a>
      </footer>
    </div>
  </article>
</Layout>
